---
source: src/completion/engine.rs
expression: "output.join(\"\\n\")"
---
status	Show UPS status	monitor	space
battery	Show battery charge and runtime, or run a guarded self-test	monitor	space
events	Show UPS event history	monitor	space
beeper	Show or change the UPS beeper	act	space
notify	Send or inspect UPS notifications	act	space
init	Plan or apply NUT configuration	set up	space
rollback	List or restore a configuration backup	set up	space
config	Inspect, scaffold, render, or diff host settings	set up	space
doctor	Check UPS protection and recovery readiness	prove	space
bios	Guide and verify BIOS recovery settings	prove	space
drill	Guide and record a physical outage drill	prove	space
completion	Install, inspect, or remove shell completion	shell	space
